  "description": "Maker-only two-sided pair for a small bankroll. Both legs are quoted strictly under their own asks (post-only, entry_maker, never at the ask) with EQUAL share counts, or neither leg is sent. The cost test is the two quotes themselves (maker fee 0); a missing or crossing quote cancels the whole attempt. atomic_batch plus pair={key,leg} makes the kernel drop the cycle if one leg is refused. There is no one-sided gap-fill: a partial fill is not chased. Collection is a merge, not a sell. Not enabled by any shipped allowlist — the frozen-window replay does not measure maker fill rate. Signal-only.",
